Also with MinBlocks >= 1... note MinBlocks=1 means identifier appears in at least 1 block — same as no filter effectively (any matching occurrence means its id appears in ≥1 block). Actually yes, MinBlocks=1 is equivalent to disabled for results, but stats same. Fine, treat uniformly.

